            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is an article comprising an optical element on its surface. The optical element has a first minimum percent reflectance in a first wavelength range within the wavelength range of about 380 to 565 nanometers. The first wavelength range has at least one peak. The at least one peak has a first width of about 10 to 185 nanometers. The first minimum percent reflectance is about 50 percent or more. The optical element imparts a structural color that corresponds substantially to the at least one peak. The optical element comprises reflective layers and constituent layers, including a base titanium reflective layer disposed on one side of the optical element and adjacent to a titanium oxide layer, and a non-base titanium reflective layer disposed between a pair of constituent layers of the optical element, adjacent to a titanium oxide layer. Also provided are related products and methods.</p>
            </abstract>
